  "content": "# 第26题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n26. The activities Alice joined in helped her to become more ________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. intelligent\n\nB. B. confident\n\nC. C. innovative\n\nD. D. critical\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查非谓语动词。现在分词作伴随状语，表示主动进行。句意：他坐在那里，看着窗外。故选A。"
